 ggie pursued stand-up comedy when she realized it’s a lot more fun than 
 ‘book club’. Her deadpan style and sarcastic storytelling about marriag
 e\, motherhood and mammograms has won over audiences of all ages. Maggie ha
 s 140K+ social followers\, 30M+ views on Instagram & TikTok\, with several 
 viral clips landing her on Inside Edition\, Yahoo News\, The New York Post\
 , Daily Mail\, Business Insider & Fox News. Maggie performs regularly at Za
 nies Chicago where she sold out 3 shows in her headlining debut. She recent
 ly performed for Nateland’s “The Showcase\, Season 3”. She is also th
 e co-founder of ALL THAT GOOD STUFF\, a comedy showcase and production comp
 any.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering th
